<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Baltic on Fire, 1988</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "st1" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;NATO vs Warsaw Pact&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/STRONG&gt; 2 June 1988 / 04:00:00 Zulu&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location:&lt;/STRONG&gt; &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Baltic Sea&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides&lt;/STRONG&gt;: Nato, Warsaw Pact&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;Introduction&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;On 12 February 1988 the &lt;EM&gt;USS Yorktown&lt;/EM&gt; (CG-48) was bumped by the Soviet Krivak I class Frigate &lt;FONT color=#252525&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Bezzavetnyy &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;in the Black Sea.&amp;nbsp; As a result of the collision two Harpoon canisters were torn lose from their mounts on &lt;EM&gt;Yorktown&lt;/EM&gt; causing a fire that detonted both warheads.&amp;nbsp; The resulting fire severe damaged the American ship but the explosion also set the &lt;FONT color=#252525&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Bezzavetnyy&lt;STRONG&gt; &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;ablaze.&amp;nbsp; The Soviets were finally able to get the conflaguration under control but only after a heavy loss of life.&amp;nbsp; The succeeding months led to ever increasingly recriminations by both sides placing blame for the incident on each other.&amp;nbsp; As diplomatic efforts becaming increasingly futile both sides began mobilzing their forces for war.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=#252525 face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;U&gt;Scenario Notes:&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;This is a large scenario depicting the opening hours of WWIII in the Baltic Sea.&amp;nbsp; It depicts a combined Warsaw Pact attempt to insert ground forces into the Zealand Region of Denmark.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
